                <mxCell id="boXr9ndk2-u8xTsZrnVh-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1" value="&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;This flowchart illustrates the structural hierarchy and core functionalities of an administrative dashboard, branching out into major operational modules like user, product, dataset, and AI analysis management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;. Each module connects to its respective database and outlines detailed sub-tasks, such as banning users, editing products, validating datasets, and monitoring AI performance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;. Additionally, the system incorporates tracking for reports, feedback, and system logs to maintain administrative oversight&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;. The entire workflow ultimately concludes with a centralized logout and session termination step&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
